-RPX290\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-rpx290\", \"category\": \"rental\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-rpx290.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-rpx290\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.97mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"4,500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"168 x 168 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the RentalPro X 2.9mm suitable for fast setups?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"RentalPro X 2.9mm features lightweight die-cast aluminum cabinets and a tool-free quick-lock system, enabling rapid assembly and disassembly\\u2014ideal for fast turnarounds on touring rigs and live events.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the 2.97mm pixel pitch impact visual quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The 2.97mm pixel pitch provides sharp, high-resolution images suitable for viewing distances typical in concerts and exhibitions, ensuring clear visibility even up close.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the importance of the 7,680Hz refresh rate?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A high refresh rate of 7,680Hz eliminates flicker and moir\\u00e9 effects, especially important for live broadcast and camera capture, delivering smooth, flicker-free visuals on video recordings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this display suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the RentalPro X 2.9mm has an IP65 rating, making it dust-tight and protected against water jets, which allows reliable performance in outdoor environments such as concerts and exhibitions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the RentalPro X 2.9mm compare to larger pixel pitch rental displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With its finer 2.97mm pixel pitch, RentalPro X 2.9mm offers higher image clarity and detail than larger pixel pitch models, making it ideal for events requiring close viewing, while still being lightweight and easy to transport.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the weight and size benefits for touring applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each 500 x 500mm panel weighs only 7.3 kg, making it easier to handle and rig on touring setups. Its curvable design (-10 to +10 degrees) enhances creative staging options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the average power consumption for this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The RentalPro X 2.9mm consumes approximately 340W per square meter on average, providing a balance of brightness and energy efficiency suitable for prolonged events.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support are offered with this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty coverage and technical support to ensure maximum uptime during tours and events, including prompt servicing and replacement if required.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"RentalPro X 2.9mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-rpx290\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>RentalPro X 2.9mm</h1><p>Rent RentalPro X 2.9mm LED displays in Dubai for events. Brightluxx offers premium rental LED solutions across UAE. Get your quote now!</p><p><strong>Built for fast turnarounds and touring rigs.</strong></p><p>The industry standard for live events and exhibitions. Lightweight die-cast cabinets, tool-free connections, and curving capability. 10,000:1 contrast and 7,680Hz refresh for moire-free camera capture.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the RentalPro X 2.9mm suitable for fast setups?</h3><p>RentalPro X 2.9mm features lightweight die-cast aluminum cabinets and a tool-free quick-lock system, enabling rapid assembly and disassembly—ideal for fast turnarounds on touring rigs and live events.</p><h3>How does the 2.97mm pixel pitch impact visual quality?</h3><p>The 2.97mm pixel pitch provides sharp, high-resolution images suitable for viewing distances typical in concerts and exhibitions, ensuring clear visibility even up close.</p><h3>What is the importance of the 7,680Hz refresh rate?</h3><p>A high refresh rate of 7,680Hz eliminates flicker and moiré effects, especially important for live broadcast and camera capture, delivering smooth, flicker-free visuals on video recordings.</p><h3>Is this display suitable for outdoor use?</h3><p>Yes, the RentalPro X 2.9mm has an IP65 rating, making it dust-tight and protected against water jets, which allows reliable performance in outdoor environments such as concerts and exhibitions.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><scrip