 cabinets, tool-free connections, and curving capability. 10,000:1 contrast and 7,680Hz refresh for moire-free camera capture.\", \"sku\": \"BL-RPX290\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-rpx290\", \"category\": \"rental\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-rpx290.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-rpx290\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.97mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"4,500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"168 x 168 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta9f,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the RentalPro X 2.9mm suitable for fast setups?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"RentalPro X 2.9mm features lightweight die-cast aluminum cabinets and a tool-free quick-lock system, enabling rapid assembly and disassembly\\u2014ideal for fast turnarounds on touring rigs and live events.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the 2.97mm pixel pitch impact visual quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The 2.97mm pixel pitch provides sharp, high-resolution images suitable for viewing distances typical in concerts and exhibitions, ensuring clear visibility even up close.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the importance of the 7,680Hz refresh rate?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A high refresh rate of 7,680Hz eliminates flicker and moir\\u00e9 effects, especially important for live broadcast and camera capture, delivering smooth, flicker-free visuals on video recordings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this display suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the RentalPro X 2.9mm has an IP65 rating, making it dust-tight and protected against water jets, which allows reliable performance in outdoor environments such as concerts and exhibitions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the RentalPro X 2.9mm compare to larger pixel pitch rental displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With its finer 2.97mm pixel pitch, RentalPro X 2.9mm offers higher image clarity and detail than larger pixel pitch models, making it ideal for events requiring close viewing, while still being lightweight and easy to transport.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the weight and size benefits for touring applications?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each 500 x 500mm panel weighs only 7.3 kg, making it easier to handle and rig on touring setups. Its curvable design (-10 to +10 degrees) enhances creative staging options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the average power consumption for this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The RentalPro X 2.9mm consumes approximately 340W per square meter on average, providing a balance of brightness and energy efficiency suitable for prolonged events.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support are offered with this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty coverage and technical support to ensure maximum uptime during tours and events, including prompt servicing and replacement if required.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"RentalPro X 2.9mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-rpx290\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T5c7,<h1>RentalPro X 2.9mm</h1><p>Rent RentalPro X 2.9mm LED displays in Dubai for events. Brightluxx offers premium rental LED solutions across UAE. Get your quote now!</p><p><strong>Built for fast turnarounds and touring rigs.</strong></p><p>The industry standard for live events and exhibitions. Lightweight die-cast cabinets, tool-free connections, and curving capability. 10,000:1 contrast and 7,680Hz refresh for moire-free camera capture.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the RentalPro X 2.9mm suitable for fast setups?</h3><p>RentalPro X 2.9mm features lightweight die-cast aluminum cabinets and a tool-free quick-lock system, enabling rapid assembly and disassembly—ideal for fast turnarounds on touring rigs and live events.</p><h3>How does the 2.97mm pixel pitch impact visual quality?</h3><p>The 2.97mm pixel pitch provides sharp, high-resolution images suitable for viewing distances typical in concerts and exhibitions, ensuring clear visibility even up close.</p><h3>What is the importance of the 7,680Hz refresh rate?</h3><p>A high refresh rate of 7,680Hz eliminates flicker and moiré effects, especially important for live broadcast and camera capture, delivering smooth, flicker-free visuals on video recordings.</p><h3>Is this display suitable for outdoor use?</h3><p>Yes, the RentalPro X 2.9mm has an IP65 rating, making it dust-tight and protected against water jets, which allows reliable performance in outdoor environments such as concerts and exhibitions.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"RentalPro X 2.9mm LED Display | Rental LED Screens Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Rent RentalPro X 2.9mm LED displays in Dubai for events. Brightluxx offers premium rental LED solutions across UAE. Get your quote now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-rpx290\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/bl-rpx290\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"nam